# Source packages Axon OS rebuilds for Ubuntu 24.04 (noble) from a newer Ubuntu release,
# unchanged apart from the version number. Built in order by scripts/build-backports.sh;
# each package can use the ones before it. Columns: source package, release to take it from,
# exact version (pinned, so a build is the same tomorrow as today).
#
# Why: Ubuntu 24.04 has no Gamescope (the Axon Console session needs it), and Gamescope 3.16
# needs libraries newer than noble has. Checked against the archive indexes on 2026-10-27:
#   libwlroots-0.18-dev (noble: none), libliftoff-dev >= 0.5.0 (noble: 0.4.1),
#   vkroots-headers >= 0~202404300106 (noble: 0~202311190157), libxcb-errors-dev (noble: none),
#   and, for wlroots, libwayland-dev >= 1.23 (noble: 1.22).
#
# wayland replaces Ubuntu's libwayland-* on systems that use the Axon repository. The library keeps
# its soname and is backward compatible, and Ubuntu 25.04 and later ship 1.23 and newer, but it is
# the one entry here that changes a package the whole desktop uses.
libliftoff        questing  0.5.0-1.1
vkroots           questing  0~202404300106git5106d8a-2
xcb-util-errors   questing  1.0.1-4
wayland           questing  1.24.0-1build1
wlroots           questing  0.18.2-3
gamescope         questing  3.16.15-2
